{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02947",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 6.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Doctor, if you're free, we can start. I've got the numbers noted down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.69,
      "end_seconds": 11.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.29,
      "end_seconds": 16.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.42,
      "end_seconds": 24.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Um, so... bright red blood on the paper. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 25.81,
      "end_seconds": 32.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Blood pressure 114 over 74, temperature 36.5, pulse 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.27,
      "end_seconds": 34.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.97,
      "end_seconds": 53.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.71,
      "end_seconds": 64.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.07,
      "text": "Let me think, um, it's been going on for two months. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.59,
      "end_seconds": 73.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 73.44,
      "end_seconds": 80.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "Actually, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.33,
      "end_seconds": 92.92,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "I was getting to that! Ah, uh, I've also had a lump around the back passage, for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.45,
      "end_seconds": 99.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Any itching as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.73,
      "end_seconds": 111.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.93,
      "text": "Well, yes, about the same, about two weeks. Yeah, you know, as for itching, honestly, a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.93,
      "end_seconds": 120.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "Have you had bright red blood on the paper before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.0,
      "end_seconds": 127.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last year. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 128.73,
      "end_seconds": 131.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.98,
      "end_seconds": 134.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Nothing like change in bowel habit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.21,
      "end_seconds": 139.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "No. No change in bowel habit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.3,
      "end_seconds": 145.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Have you noticed weight loss, black stools or tummy pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.94,
      "end_seconds": 152.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "I haven't had weight loss, black stools or tummy pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.17,
      "end_seconds": 157.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.57,
      "end_seconds": 161.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.73,
      "end_seconds": 165.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.75,
      "end_seconds": 169.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.09,
      "end_seconds": 173.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.27,
      "end_seconds": 189.58,
      "duration_seconds": 14.31,
      "text": "Let me think, I take Asthalin inhaler, when needed. I've never really been one for hospitals. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.59,
      "end_seconds": 202.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "Erm, um, it's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.02,
      "end_seconds": 206.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.63,
      "end_seconds": 222.0,
      "duration_seconds": 13.37,
      "text": "For the heart rhythm, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. Sumatriptan, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.63,
      "end_seconds": 225.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.28,
      "end_seconds": 227.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "50 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.84,
      "end_seconds": 229.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.42,
      "end_seconds": 233.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "I have asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.99,
      "end_seconds": 236.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Alright, any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.71,
      "end_seconds": 246.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "An irregular heartbeat, for five years. Migraines, for nearly five years. Diabetes, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.83,
      "end_seconds": 259.93,
      "duration_seconds": 12.1,
      "text": "Right, so asthma and diabetes are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.95,
      "end_seconds": 268.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Let me think, my grandmother had dementia. My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.71,
      "end_seconds": 273.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.1,
      "end_seconds": 278.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Nothing, you know, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.98,
      "end_seconds": 289.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.29,
      "end_seconds": 295.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 296.82,
      "end_seconds": 305.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "Hold on, um, doctor, I think he reacted to amoxicillin once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.87,
      "end_seconds": 311.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I don't remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.31,
      "end_seconds": 316.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Fair enough, I'll write down both versions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.62,
      "end_seconds": 326.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.08,
      "end_seconds": 336.74,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.65,
      "end_seconds": 373.23,
      "duration_seconds": 34.58,
      "text": "From what you've told me, it points towards haemorrhoids. We shouldn't forget an anal fissure. I think a blood count makes sense here, for rectal bleeding. What I'm giving you is a haemorrhoid cream, 1 application, twice a day, one week. That's for haemorrhoids. The treatment will be lactulose, 15 ml, twice a day, four weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for constipation. Eat more fibre and drink water."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.14,
      "end_seconds": 385.48,
      "duration_seconds": 11.34,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. Book a review in four weeks. Right, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.89,
      "end_seconds": 391.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Let me think, no, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.12,
      "end_seconds": 395.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}